      "claim": "Some large, polar, or macrocyclic comparators show restricted CNS distribution: mithramycin had a CSF:plasma ratio of 0.12 in monkeys, temsirolimus was detected in CSF in only 1 of 9 patients, brusatol was undetectable in mouse brain, and levofloxacin had a brain/plasma ratio of 0.15 in rats. These are contradictory signals for the query.",
