      "claim": "More transferable direct CNS exposure data support meaningful access for complex, piperazine-containing, or natural-product-like molecules: compound 1a achieved a brain/plasma Kp of 3.4 in rats, larotaxel crossed the BBB with minimal P-gp efflux, NKH477 crossed the BBB in rats, and bufotalin reached brain concentrations higher than plasma in mice.",
